      "reason": "The bad death of sinners and guilt of those hating the righteous need a particular supported comparison. The inspected Proverbs14:32 text concerns being thrust away in wickedness and trust in piety, without the expected death wording; it is not substituted for another edition.",
      "source_unit_read": true,
